# Optional local overrides. Copy to `docker-compose.override.yml` to customize.
# Docker Compose automatically merges override files on top of docker-compose.yml.
#
# Example use cases:
#  - Use a different Mongo image
#  - Add a mongo-express UI
#  - Expose backend on a different port
#
# Everything below is COMMENTED OUT by default.

